# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform. The scaffold hashes rulebooks
# byte for byte into a seated project's docs/team/seat-skills.lock, so a CRLF checkout would change
# every hash and examples/tally/docs/team/seat-skills.lock would read as stale.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary

# Generated by tools/ and compared by check.py; never edit by hand. GitHub collapses them in diffs.
docs/seats.md linguist-generated
docs/facts.json linguist-generated

# The generated half of examples/tally/, as tools/build_tally_example.py lists it.
examples/tally/.claude/agents/*.md linguist-generated
examples/tally/.gitignore linguist-generated
examples/tally/CLAUDE.md linguist-generated
examples/tally/docs/TEAM.md linguist-generated
examples/tally/docs/team/*.md linguist-generated
examples/tally/docs/team/seat-skills.lock linguist-generated
examples/tally/scratchpad/team/README.md linguist-generated
# Written by hand, the way a working team fills them. docs/DECISIONS.md is generated only up to the
# team's own decision, so it stays unmarked.
examples/tally/docs/team/engineering.md -linguist-generated
examples/tally/docs/team/tracker.md -linguist-generated
examples/tally/docs/team/owner-questions.md -linguist-generated
